{"id":"wb-6-1061","name":"允燕塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"允燕塔","text":"允燕塔（傣那语：ᥐᥩᥒᥰ ᥛᥧᥰ ᥝᥥᥒᥰ ᥟᥦᥒᥱ，广母允燕），又名勐町塔，位于中华人民共和国云南省德宏傣族景颇族自治州盈江县允燕村马鹿场勐町寨后允燕山上的一座傣族佛塔，是全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%81%E7%87%95%E5%A1%94","revisionId":87615827,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87615827","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/61ffefe1e70b6a8bea2b3bc2.jpg","title":"允燕塔_-_2024-05-28_-01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%85%81%E7%87%95%E5%A1%94_-_2024-05-28_-01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/97/%E5%85%81%E7%87%95%E5%A1%94_-_2024-05-28_-01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"瑞丽江的河水","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​盈江县允燕塔","width":320,"height":240}}